# Golden-master reference data for the Generate Squares regression gate.
#
# Only the per-experiment INPUT + OUTPUT CSVs are committed:
#   221012/Experiment Info.csv, Recordings.csv, Tracks.csv  (inputs)
#   221012/Squares.csv                                       (golden output)
#   Paint Configuration.json                                 (records the params used)
#
# Everything below is generated/derived and must NOT be committed.

# Generated image artifacts (also covered globally by the root .gitignore)
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.tif
*.tiff
*.png

# Per-experiment generated artifacts
Brightfield Images/
TrackMate Images/
Output/
Logs/
logs/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Project-level concatenated CSVs at the reference-project root
# (derivable by re-running the pipeline; not needed as gate inputs)
/Experiment Info.csv
/Recordings.csv
/Squares.csv
/Tracks.csv
